            "body": "$Gate the array address-mux insertion with the same per-array existence check used for the register node.\\n\\nAdds a regression covering reset-loop and indexed writes to the same array.\\n\\nFixes #101\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed duplicate address-mux generation for multiple indexed writes to the same array.\n  * Preserved distinct array index paths and correct write priority.\n  * Improved handling of full-array reset loops, including non-zero reset values.\n  * Ensured reset and array write connections remain complete and correctly wired.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Added regression and visual coverage for chained address muxes, repeated indexed writes, full-array resets, and partial-range reset handling.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
            "closed_at": null,
